  "body": "### What's New in MUXIS v1.2.13\n- Switched Android APK & AAB builds from ephemeral runner debug keys to a permanent deterministic release signing keystore (`SHA256: 6A:AF:2B:69:...:4B:CD:76:8A`), fixing Android \"App not installed as package conflicts with an existing package\" across all future in-app updates\n- Fixed mobile Google OAuth timeout & session resume on Android and iPhone\n- Unified 1-Click Google Sign-In via Firebase + Cloudflare D1 cloud sync (playlists, favorites, history, themes, 10-band EQ presets)\n- Full-storage music discovery across Android internal/SD cards and iPhone Files (`Muxis/Music`), plus official iPhone `.ipa`",
